      "created_at": "2014-08-23T13:58:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ok, making a request to the community:</p><p>I've created some homebrew character for Sentinels which are currently up on BoardGameGeek. However, while I can just about manage to create charracters and flavour text, I have godawful artistic abilities to make the cards look good.</p><p>As there are many more talented artists among the forumites, I'm wondering if anyone would be interested in assisting on the art side of things. As it's a fan deck, there's basically no money involved.</p><p>If anyone's mad enough to be interested, get in touch via PM or this thread and we can discuss the details.</p><p>Thanks all,</p><p>Paul</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:21.908Z",
