      "raw": "<p>Ok, making a request to the community:</p><p>I&#39;ve created some homebrew character for Sentinels which are currently up on BoardGameGeek. However, while I can just about manage to create charracters and flavour text, I have godawful artistic abilities to make the cards look good.</p><p>As there are many more talented artists among the forumites, I&#39;m wondering if anyone would be interested in assisting on the art side of things. As it&#39;s a fan deck, there&#39;s basically no money involved.</p><p>If anyone&#39;s mad enough to be interested, get in touch via PM or this thread and we can discuss the details.</p><p>Thanks all,</p><p>Paul</p>",
