      "created_at": "2014-08-23T14:57:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm afraid I can't help here, but I'll be watching with interest, since me and a few friends are in design mode too, and non of us are really artists in a drawing things sense.</p><p>That said, I'm trying to train myself up because the ability to draw things like that will be incredibly useful, and while I don't have skills in drawing I think I'm generally artistic enough to learn to the stage of half-decent. Eventually.</p><p>So if anyone fancies tutoring me a bit, that'd be great! ;)</p>",
