      "created_at": "2014-08-24T05:27:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Personally I've just used Champions Online for my \"art\". Helps that I have a lifetime membership and can easily buy any of the extra costume packs with&nbsp;the monthly stipend I get, which I haven't spent any of in nearly a year so I should have a nice amount saved up. I would love my characters to be drawn in the same style as the official cards but probably not happening unless I come into some big money.</p>",
